      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-41",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "又西二百九十里，曰泑山，神蓐收居之。其上多婴短之玉，其阳多瑾"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-07-20",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "传说中的神名"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-07-20",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西方蓐收，左耳有蛇，乘两龙。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "凉。\n\n凤凰翼其承旗兮,\n\n遇蓐收乎西皇。\n\n揽彗星以为旖兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "己。西方，金也，其帝少吴，其佐蓐收，执矩而治秋，其神为太白，其兽"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-06-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "室，饮气之民，不死之野，少皞、蓐收之所司者，万二千里。其令曰：审"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
